<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 25/28.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 25/28.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Monday, April 28 on Friday.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to</p>
<p>one.</p>
<p>		   28.04.97	  25.04.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.4958	    6.4804</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3318	    2.3264</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5402	    4.5374</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.1785	    3.1671</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5201	    0.5217</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7756	    0.7742</p>
<p>    EKK	  0.2915	    0.2908</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.8734	    6.8581</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6965	    0.6962</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2702	    1.2702</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
